E_INVALID_ARGUMENT: settings: pubtemplate: heap_mb 512mb exceeds 70% of the 512 MiB memory limit (max heap_mb 358mb — the JVM heap must leave room for metaspace, threads and page cache, or the carrier gets OOM-killed in a loop)
suggestion: Fix the flagged field and retry. Field paths point at the exact input location.
docs: https://docs.fleetly.sh/errors/E_INVALID_ARGUMENT
